    {
      "number": "219",
      "source_number": "219",
      "group": null,
      "group_id": "g0",
      "text": "219. 求出用递推法给出的数列$(a_n)$的前5项：\nа) $a_1=1,\\quad a_{n+1}=a_n+1$；\nб) $a_1=7,\\quad a_{n+1}=a_n-3$；\nв) $a_1=-5,\\quad a_{n+1}=2a_n$；\nг) $a_1=75,\\quad a_{n+1}=0.1a_n$；\nд) $a_1=\\frac{1}{6},a_{n+1}=-a_n$；\nе) $a_1=3,\\quad a_{n+1}=\\frac{1}{a_n}$.",
      "lines": [
        "219. 求出用递推法给出的数列$(a_n)$的前5项：",
        "а) $a_1=1,\\quad a_{n+1}=a_n+1$；",
        "б) $a_1=7,\\quad a_{n+1}=a_n-3$；",
        "в) $a_1=-5,\\quad a_{n+1}=2a_n$；",
        "г) $a_1=75,\\quad a_{n+1}=0.1a_n$；",
        "д) $a_1=\\frac{1}{6},a_{n+1}=-a_n$；",
        "е) $a_1=3,\\quad a_{n+1}=\\frac{1}{a_n}$."
      ],
      "pages": [
        "p0087#2"
      ],
